<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 294 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 294 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 142 million zlotys of the National Bank of Poland's 91-day NBP-bills and 152.6 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It sold the 91-day paper at an average yield of 22.00 percent, up from 21.99 percent on the last auction on January 9, 1997.</p>
<p>The average yield of the 182-day paper was 0.01 point down at 21.99 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
